{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"directoryGroupDn"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"groupID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/groupmapping\/init(directorygroupdn:groupid:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping\/init(directoryGroupDn:groupID:)"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"directoryGroupDn"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"groupID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"title":"init(directoryGroupDn:groupID:)","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK12GroupMappingV09directoryC2Dn7groupIDACSS_SStcfc","roleHeading":"Initializer","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"symbolKind":"init"},"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/GroupMapping":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/groupmapping","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One row of the group-mapping table (G-3, T23.3.4, D-30): a directory group, named by its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"distinguished name, and the AXIAM group a member of it is put into. "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The table is the only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"way a directory group reaches an AXIAM group.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" There is no match by name, no prefix or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wildcard, and no AXIAM group is ever created from a directory one: a directory administrator"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"who names a group "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"admins"},{"type":"text","text":" gains nothing unless a tenant administrator mapped it here. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"DN is stored as the administrator typed it and compared after RFC 4514 normalisation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"axiam_directory::dn"},{"type":"text","text":"), so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CN=Staff, OU=Groups"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cn=staff,ou=groups"},{"type":"text","text":" are the same row."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"One DN may map to several AXIAM groups; the same (DN, group) pair twice is refused as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"redundant."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GroupMapping"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GroupMapping"}],"title":"GroupMapping"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/GroupMapping/init(directoryGroupDn:groupID:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/groupmapping\/init(directorygroupdn:groupid:)","title":"init(directoryGroupDn:groupID:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"directoryGroupDn","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"groupID","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping\/init(directoryGroupDn:groupID:)"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","title":"AxiamSDK","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"}}}